    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_411_tomimi_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The buildings here are so different from the other tribes...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tomimi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crappy houses!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm, the architecture and decor is all pretty crude.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Got a lotta weird, broken gizmos all over the place too.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Zumama, you've got a very unique tribe here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like they enjoy fiddling around with machines just as much as you do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "This is my people's masterpiece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. They now know the charm of the machines, and they have built the tribe you see here on their passion alone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look, it's Gavial!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria A"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Great Chief wasn't lying. She's planning to duel Gavial again with the Big Ugly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria B"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?! No way I can miss that!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Archosauria C"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, there's so many people!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Many of them are from other tribes who've came here after the ceremony. They will be joining us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So, what did you want to say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Gavial, if you just left without a fuss, I wouldn't have cared. But since you're standing before me once again, I will defeat you right here and now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Why?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you're too strong, Gavial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you still remember that day?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That day?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Before that day, I was just like you. I believed the strength in my fists was everything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
