    {
        "text": "Heh, don't think you'll hit me a second time!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, those are the reflexes I'd expect from Gavial! No problem. Have a taste of my great iron fist!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "A test of strength, huh? Sounds good to me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
