    },
    {
        "text": "Wow, Gavial's strong!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ceobe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_201_moeshd_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crazy strong! She stopped its fist all by lonesome!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Croissant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know I asked way back when I got my first physical, but why is she a medic again?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You may be my opponent, but I can't help but cheer for you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not over yet though! The Big Ugly has a max performance mode for just such an occasion!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_337_utage_summer_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "That big guy looks stronger!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Utage"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_017_homura_summer"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it's suppressing Gavial's strength?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blaze"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, what a melodious sound...! Hm? Wait, these readings are strange... Whaaa?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
