    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#6"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 8,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "High Priest, what's going on?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Waah, my butt's being cooked!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm talking about the Big Ugly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, I was just sharing my status as well. I think the engine output is too high. I'm losing control of the Big Ugly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's actually quite exhilarating!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get out of there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't we fighting? Let's just fight like this! Come, Gavial, I'll finish this once and for all\u2014\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
