        "key": "$farce_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, fine. What a shame. Looks like I'll have to change tactics.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zumama, don't worry about me, I'll do my best to stabilize it. You find a way to stop the Big Ugly in the meantime!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "High Priest"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_416_zumama_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Gavial, you and your people get out of here. This isn't your business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about? Don't you want to beat me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#2",
        "name2": "char_416_zumama_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I do. But not like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eunectes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_187_ccheal_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come on. Of course I'm going to help. Right, Doctor?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Gavial"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_2013_cerber_1"
    },
